# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
# IMPORTANT: do NOT add "/* /:splat.html 200" — that Netlify-style rule rewrites
# every request (including css/js/images) by appending ".html", which 404s all
# static assets on Cloudflare. The site links to *.html directly, so clean-URL
# rewrites are unnecessary and have been removed.

# Canonical host: redirect www → apex (production domain: scholarics.com)
# This handles the "Page with redirect" Google Search Console issue for www. URLs.
https://www.scholarics.com/* https://scholarics.com/:splat 301
http://www.scholarics.com/* https://scholarics.com/:splat 301
http://scholarics.com/* https://scholarics.com/:splat 301

# Legacy 404 handling (Cloudflare Pages serves /404.html for unknown paths)
